ja|毛都亂了，先理一下喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_f0a73ec2.mp3","dur":3.83},"ninja|師父應該會誇我吧喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_87130fce.mp3","dur":2.04},"ninja|打完更餓了喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_dcebd996.mp3","dur":2.38},"ninja|餓得沒力氣了喵……":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_277308e8.mp3","dur":2.72},"ninja|飯糰吃完了喵……":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_0d22bb02.mp3","dur":3.31},"ninja|好想吃東西喵……":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_72a1a856.mp3","dur":1.94},"ninja|好痛喵……":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_b5842af2.mp3","dur":0.75},"ninja|還能再打喵……":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_c59339ff.mp3","dur":1.26},"ninja|先別過來，讓我站穩喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_39ced0f4.mp3","dur":1.87},"ninja|紙箱耶，打開看看喵！":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_fbae9d90.mp3","dur":2.22},"ninja|裡面裝了什麼喵？":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_22caba45.mp3","dur":1.97},"ninja|這個大小，我剛好鑽得進去喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_5f59e039.mp3","dur":2.59},"ninja|不會又藏著機關吧喵？":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_c361f188.mp3","dur":2.68},"ninja|先打開，再鑽進去喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_70dd39e5.mp3","dur":2.31},"ninja|睡得好舒服，還想再躺一下喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_87e213ef.mp3","dur":3.82},"ninja|這墊子真好睡喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_62d505f0.mp3","dur":2.16},"ninja|睡飽了，出發喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_0eb040bd.mp3","dur":1.76},"ninja|哈啊……起床喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_458d7598.mp3","dur":4.83},"ninja|那個香爐一直冒煙，燻得我整晚睡不著喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_e88591c7.mp3","dur":4.54},"ninja|爪子磨利了，試起來順手多了喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_5744a837.mp3","dur":2.94},"ninja|這下夠利了喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_a007c400.mp3","dur":1.77},"ninja|練好了，下次給師父看看喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_7a801bac.mp3","dur":2.0},"ninja|這招熟練多了喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_da4e6e6d.mp3","dur":2.05},"ninja|醒了就好喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_1526e6fe.mp3","dur":1.6},"ninja|嚇死我了，還以為你不起來了喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_f515ad32.mp3","dur":2.62},"ninja|站穩，等一下換你保護我喵。":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_20505327.mp3","dur":3.04},"ninja|有伏兵跳出來了喵！":{"file":"voice/ninja/ninja_af570896.mp3","dur":1.31},"feifei|……三天了。師父沒回來，師兄也沒回來。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_8cc8f03b.mp3","dur":4.16},"feifei|我還是很怕受傷。可是他們要是也在等人幫忙呢？……我得去。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_07d35a04.mp3","dur":7.93},"feifei|是師兄的頭巾。他以前也老是勾破……回去又得替他補了。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_bedf6590.mp3","dur":7.63},"feifei|師父，您再撐一下……師兄，你到底在哪裡？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_d9a3d034.mp3","dur":6.75},"feifei|我聽見了，師父。我正在上去。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_a12b8abc.mp3","dur":2.9},"feifei|師兄！對、對不起，我來晚了……":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_eaa14e94.mp3","dur":3.54},"feifei|我不退。……每次叫我退的都是你，受傷的也都是你。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_e7688527.mp3","dur":6.95},"feifei|師兄，門口交給你。這次……換我先上。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_b2985370.mp3","dur":4.57},"feifei|還沒……找到他們……":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_180480d6.mp3","dur":3.7},"feifei|傷口好了，我就回去。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_3bee4bc4.mp3","dur":2.14},"feifei|師父，這又不是切磋……您剛才連我都不認得了。師兄也是，連個消息都沒有。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_9e2eb2bb.mp3","dur":9.37},"feifei|我還以為，找不到你們了。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_b71b1520.mp3","dur":2.7},"feifei|師父、師兄，明天也一起吃早飯吧。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_2dc9600e.mp3","dur":3.87},"feifei|是師父親手寫的。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_09a73d7e.mp3","dur":2.4},"feifei|怎麼會留在這裡？他出門時總會帶著的。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_0ccf0a46.mp3","dur":4.18},"feifei|那他現在更需要有人去找他。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_ac502d65.mp3","dur":2.97},"feifei|明天要過關主守的門，光想就睡不著。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_53b84b02.mp3","dur":5.48},"feifei|藥分好了，針也檢查過了。還漏了什麼嗎？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_311216b6.mp3","dur":5.03},"feifei|再翻一次只會更清醒……把竹筒放好，睡吧。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_0aa60b70.mp3","dur":5.17},"feifei|魔氣這麼重，連呼吸都覺得嗆。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_09829c7a.mp3","dur":4.78},"feifei|剛才那一聲像師父，可我從沒聽他叫得那麼痛。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_a3af1d90.mp3","dur":7.25},"feifei|得先過眼前這一關，才走得到他那裡。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_ab155716.mp3","dur":5.84},"feifei|明天就要見到師父了。我想過好多次，卻不知道見了他該先說什麼。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_9eaada8b.mp3","dur":7.62},"feifei|師父第一次教我握針，還特地把尖端轉開，怕我扎到自己。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_6220002b.mp3","dur":8.41},"feifei|他總記得我怕痛。現在，還會記得嗎？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_eab9dd46.mp3","dur":6.35},"feifei|等見了面，我要先叫他一聲。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_ba259508.mp3","dur":2.17},"feifei|師父，我是菲菲！我站在這裡，您看看我！":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_0e2cbf4f.mp3","dur":4.34},"feifei|退隱也可以回家呀。師兄在門口等著……跟我們回去，好不好？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_11b6740f.mp3","dur":6.82},"feifei|師父，聽我的聲音。我是您教過握針的那個小徒弟。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_ecf2d0ee.mp3","dur":6.17},"feifei|師父，這套招式我認得。您教我的時候，從來不肯真的打下來。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_5f1d0bd7.mp3","dur":6.8},"feifei|婆婆，我也想回去。可是家裡少了兩個人，我不能就這樣走。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_35412395.mp3","dur":7.65},"feifei|婆婆剛才還在讓我……這下不能大意。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_642d3e74.mp3","dur":4.74},"feifei|還有救……我記住了，不在這裡耽擱。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_6bf8bd3f.mp3","dur":4.52},"feifei|這道紫光，跟師父那晚眼裡的一樣。這裡的魔物，都受了魔氣影響。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_5eeb3998.mp3","dur":8.18},"feifei|爪子這麼密……得看準空隙，別把自己逼到牆角。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_1af1886e.mp3","dur":6.01},"feifei|爪子都燒紅了，隔這麼遠還覺得燙。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_259f1a02.mp3","dur":4.21},"feifei|紫光會散，師父也能醒吧？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_96cb3055.mp3","dur":5.36},"feifei|這些是村裡丟的小魚乾嗎？你跟我師父是一夥的？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_e5bfd219.mp3","dur":7.22},"feifei|既然你怕他，為什麼還攔我？那些小魚乾，村裡也還有人等著吃。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_ae993cdd.mp3","dur":7.66},"feifei|樓梯就這麼寬，你捲成球我要躲哪裡！":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_15afb490.mp3","dur":6.62},"feifei|別再搶了。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_b96096b2.mp3","dur":2.12},"feifei|你說的二當家，是替誰守這裡？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_cadb6d67.mp3","dur":4.59},"feifei|那不是他的本意。他以前從不會叫人這樣守著路。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_a721111d.mp3","dur":7.5},"feifei|還有另一套爪法……看清楚，不能照剛才那樣接。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_fa6daea3.mp3","dur":5.35},"feifei|他以前連罰我蹲馬步都捨不得……您說的，好像是另一個人。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_ca7a8d0c.mp3","dur":8.2},"feifei|我不喝，謝謝。師父特別交代過，不能碰您的酒。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_13a67164.mp3","dur":7.33},"feifei|變出這麼多隻……哪一隻才是真的啊？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_7ad19a86.mp3","dur":3.74},"feifei|我會擦乾淨腳再走。塔頂還有人等我，請別攔我。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_214f8e42.mp3","dur":5.63},"feifei|我沒有要找你們算帳，別替她擋在前面。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_f9e4721d.mp3","dur":4.87},"feifei|借過，我只走池邊，不碰您的東西。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_be1b833f.mp3","dur":4.79},"feifei|水面都被擠滿了……這麼多，我得顧著兩邊。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_f768feff.mp3","dur":5.69},"feifei|殼上這麼多舊傷……牠也遇過那天的魔氣嗎？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_8b88d2b1.mp3","dur":5.48},"feifei|我不想碰那些傷口……能讓我從旁邊過嗎？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_507d48bb.mp3","dur":4.14},"feifei|謝謝你讓路。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_f92536dc.mp3","dur":2.09},"feifei|整條樓梯都被牠壓住了……叫醒牠，一定會生氣吧。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_cf95378d.mp3","dur":5.59},"feifei|是我把您吵醒的。可是路就這一條，我得過去。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_6b394a2c.mp3","dur":5.9},"feifei|我走了，這次不吵你。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_c6fbb0f1.mp3","dur":2.67},"feifei|我沒想要誰死。可是師父困在上面，我也不能放著他不管。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_62502538.mp3","dur":7.13},"feifei|老住持也長出鱗甲了……這還是他原本的樣子嗎？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_65511dec.mp3","dur":5.76},"feifei|他連我怕什麼都記得……不會把我全忘了的。我得親口叫叫他。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_2b9d7aab.mp3","dur":8.12},"feifei|呼吸穩住。牠的動作跟剛才不同了。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_eef5bed4.mp3","dur":3.5},"feifei|還有魔氣……不能在這裡鬆手。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_1993b70f.mp3","dur":3.69},"feifei|還有師父，他們三天都沒回來了。村裡就拜託你了。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_3ae36e27.mp3","dur":5.49},"feifei|噹、噹噹……師兄的腳扭到了，我扶不動他。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_09e2386b.mp3","dur":5.2},"feifei|師兄，我扶你過去。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_5902ed3d.mp3","dur":2.4},"feifei|那個……借過一下。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_7b2c8f52.mp3","dur":2.78},"feifei|針上有毒，別碰。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_4d6a0f06.mp3","dur":2.08},"feifei|別追了，前面沒路啦！":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_0b7d04ea.mp3","dur":2.49},"feifei|袖口綁緊，免得礙手礙腳。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_4f69002c.mp3","dur":3.06},"feifei|再靠近，我就丟針了。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_2ffc85fa.mp3","dur":2.85},"feifei|可以別打臉嗎……拜託。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_2c0096a9.mp3","dur":3.27},"feifei|我不跟你比力氣。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_e77aba70.mp3","dur":2.08},"feifei|師兄碰上你，會怎麼辦呢？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_b7f0e9e7.mp3","dur":2.35},"feifei|你一定要守在這裡嗎？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_bfa8b468.mp3","dur":2.61},"feifei|看牠的手，別只顧著怕。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_90c62c24.mp3","dur":2.28},"feifei|等一下，衣服勾住了！":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_01b5a5f4.mp3","dur":1.66},"feifei|我只是想把人接回家。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_abe5e5d2.mp3","dur":2.97},"feifei|師父教過這個，我記得。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_f4fce579.mp3","dur":2.24},"feifei|出口在後面，記住了。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_1021ce67.mp3","dur":1.61},"feifei|不動了……結束了吧？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_ac722dad.mp3","dur":4.58},"feifei|我有先提醒你喔。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_acf80f01.mp3","dur":1.79},"feifei|袖子沒破，還好。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_d7089ffa.mp3","dur":2.31},"feifei|呼，終於能喘口氣。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_22f2362f.mp3","dur":2.24},"feifei|針差點拿不住。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_dd34b080.mp3","dur":2.07},"feifei|剛才那一下好險。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_e0a87ebe.mp3","dur":1.57},"feifei|咦，真的過去了。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_202d319d.mp3","dur":2.04},"feifei|借我坐一下，腿軟。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_9cae65cb.mp3","dur":2.62},"feifei|這次沒忘記護住自己。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_620126c7.mp3","dur":2.54},"feifei|原來一直緊張也會餓。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_cb32a3bc.mp3","dur":3.22},"feifei|沒人聽見我尖叫吧？":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_0daf0ca6.mp3","dur":2.99},"feifei|手上有藥，不能揉眼睛。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_5ee5f8d1.mp3","dur":3.14},"feifei|你別再爬起來了，拜託。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_bc1784d1.mp3","dur":2.59},"feifei|針袋還在，沒弄丟。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_7e44e5a4.mp3","dur":2.05},"feifei|門口就是來時的路。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_b172ec7a.mp3","dur":2.53},"feifei|舌頭咬到了，嗚。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_62651f02.mp3","dur":3.38},"feifei|餓得使不上力了。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_b98f9767.mp3","dur":2.42},"feifei|飯糰……沒有了。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_c30f6608.mp3","dur":2.5},"feifei|現在給我白飯也好，真的。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_b111cb74.mp3","dur":4.0},"feifei|那個……剛才是肚子叫。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_bdc00b62.mp3","dur":2.85},"feifei|先別講吃的，我受不了。":{"file":"voice/feifei/feifei_e6b55c92.mp3","