ile":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_073a1b20.mp3","dur":4.43},"dangdang|那就讓路，糧食也放回來。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_ac24dd70.mp3","dur":2.51},"dangdang|要滾過來了！往旁邊閃！":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_07737d83.mp3","dur":1.71},"dangdang|桶子放著，我回來搬。別再拿了。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_4c5ee67e.mp3","dur":3.71},"dangdang|你是二當家，誰是大當家？":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_f27df43b.mp3","dur":2.96},"dangdang|那是大俠貓。他平常不會讓人堵路收東西。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_0b359cac.mp3","dur":5.36},"dangdang|換成白爪，出手的方向也變了。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_c586f413.mp3","dur":3.01},"dangdang|他以前陪我們練功，誰摔倒了，他都會伸手扶一把。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_7b44b16c.mp3","dur":5.75},"dangdang|不喝。我來找大俠貓，你知道他在哪裡嗎？":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_e37f1fdf.mp3","dur":4.23},"dangdang|煙散了，人反而更多。哪隻是真的？":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_705f2624.mp3","dur":4.05},"dangdang|我踩髒的地方，回來再擦。現在得上樓。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_bcaedb7a.mp3","dur":3.73},"dangdang|妳也往前站，別光叫他們上。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_5c5eb3f3.mp3","dur":3.29},"dangdang|借過。我只走樓梯，不進你的池子。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_f4dab884.mp3","dur":4.04},"dangdang|小兵從旁邊來了，別讓牠們繞到後面。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_177e2edc.mp3","dur":2.84},"dangdang|殼上這些傷，你也遇到塔裡的魔物了？":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_d0563b83.mp3","dur":4.08},"dangdang|我從旁邊過。能不能挪開一點？":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_b5ec31ad.mp3","dur":2.58},"dangdang|剛才打痛你了，對不住。謝謝你讓路。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_8841af54.mp3","dur":3.77},"dangdang|醒一醒，你壓住樓梯了。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_e6477a81.mp3","dur":2.09},"dangdang|終於睜眼了。這下得小心。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_8726cb07.mp3","dur":3.39},"dangdang|路空出來了。好，你接著睡。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_edc25e8c.mp3","dur":3.21},"dangdang|我沒有殺誰。我是來接大俠貓回去的。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_b8c70f8e.mp3","dur":3.58},"dangdang|鱗甲還在長，魔氣沒停。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_565a1984.mp3","dur":3.23},"dangdang|他的兩個徒弟都在找他。我這就上去。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_74b6e369.mp3","dur":3.61},"dangdang|架勢換了，不能照剛才那樣接。":{"file":"voice/dangdan