:2.4},"dangdang|箱蓋沒釘死，能打開。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_31b1d6bc.mp3","dur":2.22},"dangdang|我先看看裡面。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_92b6e6bb.mp3","dur":1.27},"dangdang|這箱角包得挺牢。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_19487d21.mp3","dur":2.63},"dangdang|該不會是裝石頭的吧。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_7da9beca.mp3","dur":2.89},"dangdang|蓋子有點卡，從這邊掀。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_1764b030.mp3","dur":2.91},"dangdang|裡頭沒聲音。打開看看。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_46ce38ac.mp3","dur":2.68},"dangdang|肩膀不那麼緊了。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_bd049258.mp3","dur":1.62},"dangdang|睡著的時候，手還緊緊握著。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_f981adb8.mp3","dur":3.04},"dangdang|這墊子挺厚。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_8f1b492e.mp3","dur":2.75},"dangdang|剛才壓到尾巴了……":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_38074c27.mp3","dur":1.96},"dangdang|把護臂戴回去，走吧。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_40cbe9fb.mp3","dur":1.85},"dangdang|睡過一覺，眼睛總算睜得開。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_dfc3dde4.mp3","dur":3.15},"dangdang|香爐還在冒煙。躺了半天，一點都沒睡著。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_ef454f12.mp3","dur":6.53},"dangdang|剛才是腳站太窄了。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_a865cba8.mp3","dur":2.68},"dangdang|換這個角度，接起來順多了。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_0b630c3d.mp3","dur":2.65},"dangdang|收手要跟上。再來就不會卡了。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_1c86e806.mp3","dur":3.8},"dangdang|這一下總算做對了。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_03fe8920.mp3","dur":2.08},"dangdang|原來不用抬那麼高。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_e69a19b0.mp3","dur":2.52},"dangdang|練好了，記住這個位置。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_e7c4cfe4.mp3","dur":3.05},"dangdang|醒了？先坐好。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_32ef8cf5.mp3","dur":1.84},"dangdang|手搭過來，我扶你。":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_ed144a08.mp3","dur":2.11},"dangdang|看著我。認得我是誰吧？":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_1d5067a4.mp3","dur":2.31},"dangdang|有伏兵跳出來了！":{"file":"voice/dangdang/dangdang_92968d43.mp3","dur":1.27},"fengfeng|門檻上散著的，都是村裡被搶走的小魚乾。他們應該也是從這裡進去的。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_f9a64d29.mp3","dur":6.77},"fengfeng|每次回村，都是他們在路口等我。這次換我去找。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_4dd0780f.mp3","dur":7.55},"fengfeng|箱子搬到這裡，裡面的東西倒是被吃得乾乾淨淨。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_5d91fa17.mp3","dur":4.82},"fengfeng|上面有人。我去問問。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_f4436c2b.mp3","dur":1.87},"fengfeng|你受傷了？":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_c74d553c.mp3","dur":0.98},"fengfeng|你把牠送出去。我去找他們。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_16bad50c.mp3","dur":3.47},"fengfeng|我知道。你退到門邊，別伸手擋劍。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_e20f9d53.mp3","dur":3.75},"fengfeng|門口交給你們。有人上來就叫我。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_84244628.mp3","dur":2.28},"fengfeng|我的朋友有回來嗎？":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_e0e6c79a.mp3","dur":1.79},"fengfeng|您認得我了。先坐下，我把劍收好。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_4c76a3cd.mp3","dur":4.18},"fengfeng|看過兩邊了，沒人。等我收劍，你再進來。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_636f7ed9.mp3","dur":4.21},"fengfeng|下一趟貨晚幾天再送，先在村裡把傷養好。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_570ce872.mp3","dur":4.93},"fengfeng|這本書上的字，我在大俠貓的院子裡見過。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_8af05431.mp3","dur":3.78},"fengfeng|書掉在這裡，他應該已經往上走了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_fe5f166b.mp3","dur":3.72},"fengfeng|那就更得把他帶回村裡。我不能當作沒聽見。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_f2795f1d.mp3","dur":4.31},"fengfeng|樓上就是守關的。回程的路，我先在心裡走一遍。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_c9309a20.mp3","dur":4.99},"fengfeng|劍放在右手邊，半夜拔出來也不會碰到牆。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_eef71ef0.mp3","dur":3.35},"fengfeng|天亮前還早。先睡，還是把收劍那一下再練順？":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_9c486b5e.mp3","dur":6.68},"fengfeng|這股味道跟山谷裡的瘴氣很像，越往上越濃。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_1caaf871.mp3","dur":4.69},"fengfeng|那聲吼從正上方傳來。大俠貓離這裡不遠了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_c0abe711.mp3","dur":3.49},"fengfeng|明天那一關路窄，劍得收短一點出。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_97df8748.mp3","dur":4.2},"fengfeng|明天就到塔頂。送了這麼多年的貨，這是最難走的一段。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_586bdf03.mp3","dur":6.58},"fengfeng|以前在院子練劍，他總叫我先看兩邊有沒有人，再出手。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_c10a62be.mp3","dur":7.76},"fengfeng|明天他就站在劍路上。這一劍，只能架，不能砍。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_07d2c0ed.mp3","dur":7.09},"fengfeng|回程要揹人下樓。水袋裝滿，繩子也備好了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_2f03f628.mp3","dur":5.47},"fengfeng|大俠貓，是我，封封。球球和菲菲已經退到門邊了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_6ea55dd0.mp3","dur":5.47},"fengfeng|您要回村，我們就陪您下去。先把手放下。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_3d02601b.mp3","dur":5.05},"fengfeng|大俠貓，您看清楚！我不是來跟您比劍的！":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_c58b0839.mp3","dur":4.07},"fengfeng|您的手受傷了，再使力會更嚴重！":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_d1849985.mp3","dur":3.99},"fengfeng|婆婆，我來找大俠貓和他的兩個徒弟。他們都沒回村。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_3598007f.mp3","dur":4.89},"fengfeng|尾巴又多了幾條。劍得收短，別讓它們纏上。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_72f5a68c.mp3","dur":4.03},"fengfeng|他還有救。謝謝婆婆告訴我。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_dc0ad162.mp3","dur":3.33},"fengfeng|紫光從鐵皮縫裡透出來。劍從那道縫進得去。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_cad6be8b.mp3","dur":5.14},"fengfeng|鐵爪張得太開了。我從側面過。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_d7db89f9.mp3","dur":2.56},"fengfeng|爪子燒紅了，碰到劍柄都會燙手！":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_a4d4d1bd.mp3","dur":3.98},"fengfeng|紫光散了，機關也停了。上面那股魔氣應該也能除掉。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_4403f888.mp3","dur":5.81},"fengfeng|桶子上的繩結是村裡的綁法。這些糧，你替塔頂那位收的？":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_c98e402f.mp3","dur":7.19},"fengfeng|糧食留下，樓梯也讓開。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_bddd85dc.mp3","dur":2.81},"fengfeng|身體壓下來了，牠要往前撞！":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_640e0052.mp3","dur":2.58},"fengfeng|那些是村裡的糧食，別再吃了。我下樓時來拿。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_02c0004f.mp3","dur":3.95},"fengfeng|有二當家，就有大當家。他在哪一層？":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_abdd0030.mp3","dur":4.22},"fengfeng|大俠貓不會指使人搶糧。你沒看出他不對勁？":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_8ea0a0c6.mp3","dur":5.5},"fengfeng|換成白爪了。這次是從另一邊打過來。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_b40805de.mp3","dur":3.15},"fengfeng|他平常不會這樣。我得上去看看他。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_f00ebc6e.mp3","dur":4.05},"fengfeng|趕路的人不喝酒，喝了就走不直。我找的是大俠貓。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_ea8f88af.mp3","dur":6.48},"fengfeng|影子突然多了，得認清拿酒葫蘆的那隻。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_b6934596.mp3","dur":4.07},"fengfeng|鞋底的泥我會擦掉。我得去塔頂找大俠貓，請妳讓路。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_d50d2346.mp3","dur":6.28},"fengfeng|他們都上來了。妳也要一起打？":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_a0bce5e5.mp3","dur":3.12},"fengfeng|借過。池邊留一條路給我就好，劍不會出鞘。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_1deb37dc.mp3","dur":5.16},"fengfeng|旁邊有腳步聲，小兵來了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_a88f486c.mp3","dur":2.47},"fengfeng|殼上的傷還很新。是這裡的魔物打的？":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_cdee81f4.mp3","dur":4.01},"fengfeng|你擋住路了。我得從這裡上去。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_4354e58f.mp3","dur":3.35},"fengfeng|謝謝你挪開。我從旁邊走，不碰你的傷。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_2fe0403e.mp3","dur":3.51},"fengfeng|這段樓梯是唯一的路。對不住，得請你挪一挪。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_9efba97a.mp3","dur":5.7},"fengfeng|牠醒了。劍先收近一點，別被咬住。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_2a7256f0.mp3","dur":3.53},"fengfeng|樓梯露出來了。我走了，你繼續睡。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_b5c45fa0.mp3","dur":3.6},"fengfeng|我來接大俠貓回村。你見過他嗎？":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_eed78700.mp3","dur":4.12},"fengfeng|鱗甲還在長，剛才的地方打不進去了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_95aae1fd.mp3","dur":3.63},"fengfeng|最掛念的人……是球球和菲菲。我先上去，替他們把路清出來。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_8239f517.mp3","dur":8.03},"fengfeng|步子變了。剛才量好的距離，不算數了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_7948749d.mp3","dur":3.95},"fengfeng|魔氣又多了。得把眼前這一關打完。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_5fa88f1b.mp3","dur":4.26},"fengfeng|把武器放下，我只是要過去。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_5160179d.mp3","dur":2.34},"fengfeng|你一直跟到這裡，是想搶東西？":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_295f1018.mp3","dur":2.78},"fengfeng|前面沒路可繞，只能從這裡過了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_8c0d0384.mp3","dur":2.66},"fengfeng|別碰我的行囊。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_e49f82e8.mp3","dur":1.26},"fengfeng|站這麼近，我可不會收著劍。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_b40883a7.mp3","dur":3.14},"fengfeng|躲在那裡，我的劍也夠得到。出來吧。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_e5aa558f.mp3","dur":3.7},"fengfeng|劍柄沒鬆，還能用。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_ada537b5.mp3","dur":2.21},"fengfeng|這邊比較空，往這邊打。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_57fe38ff.mp3","dur":2.4},"fengfeng|這次看清楚你的動作了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_cf577d85.mp3","dur":1.5},"fengfeng|把劍拔出來，衣角別纏上去。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_b4269102.mp3","dur":2.53},"fengfeng|你堵著門，我就得先跟你打一場。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_4d1095d8.mp3","dur":3.32},"fengfeng|爪子收回去，別伸到劍前面。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_53d96724.mp3","dur":2.62},"fengfeng|這裡的路比山上還難走。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_335a8ce2.mp3","dur":2.43},"fengfeng|行囊放好了。我來會會你。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_62d836f4.mp3","dur":1.85},"fengfeng|這一場打完了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_39897c66.mp3","dur":1.4},"fengfeng|劍上都是灰，擦乾淨再收。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_7ad788ec.mp3","dur":3.11},"fengfeng|剛才差點滑倒，鞋底得清一清。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_c1d222d8.mp3","dur":3.73},"fengfeng|手臂有點痠，換隻手拿。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_be32d9c1.mp3","dur":2.91},"fengfeng|收劍前先看一眼身後。沒人，好。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_d59a062e.mp3","dur":4.55},"fengfeng|劍穗纏住了，難怪一直拉著手。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_21dac3e3.mp3","dur":4.16},"fengfeng|繩結沒鬆，行囊也還在。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_1f04abbb.mp3","dur":2.79},"fengfeng|出劍的位置比剛才寬多了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_200a9c8e.mp3","dur":3.37},"fengfeng|劍身還在嗡嗡響，等它停了再收。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_7e6d1f56.mp3","dur":2.86},"fengfeng|終於聽得見自己的呼吸了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_82845963.mp3","dur":1.89},"fengfeng|水袋放哪裡去了？在這裡。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_07e67a51.mp3","dur":3.03},"fengfeng|肩膀拉到了，抬手有點痛。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_10ebcb44.mp3","dur":3.58},"fengfeng|灰都進領口了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_5e890787.mp3","dur":1.88},"fengfeng|劍先收好，免得走路碰到牆。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_4c3c3866.mp3","dur":3.81},"fengfeng|還有一段樓梯要走。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_e04a2cfb.mp3","dur":1.54},"fengfeng|這塊地板會滑，回來時得記住。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_8ff125d3.mp3","dur":3.68},"fengfeng|乾糧算少了，這一劍撐不起來。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_c681bd4f.mp3","dur":4.19},"fengfeng|剩下的力氣不夠使這招。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_2ca54e32.mp3","dur":3.3},"fengfeng|水袋還有，飯糰沒了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_77a61173.mp3","dur":2.79},"fengfeng|得省著用剩下的飯糰。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_6d1cbe67.mp3","dur":2.26},"fengfeng|這一劍太吃力，先緩一口氣再出。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_49ff93e5.mp3","dur":3.78},"fengfeng|還差一顆飯糰。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_aa628dba.mp3","dur":1.77},"fengfeng|再出這招，力氣就不夠了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_0f00f9df.mp3","dur":3.16},"fengfeng|先換一招省力的。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_95a1d286.mp3","dur":2.1},"fengfeng|手抖得快握不住劍了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_9b5e40b5.mp3","dur":3.1},"fengfeng|這裡的傷又裂開了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_43085a05.mp3","dur":1.68},"fengfeng|腿使不上力，得扶著牆。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_90ba7285.mp3","dur":3.64},"fengfeng|別再打到這隻手。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_59ece2a9.mp3","dur":2.58},"fengfeng|眼前有些模糊，不能再往前衝。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_13fdc80a.mp3","dur":3.3},"fengfeng|得找機會把血止住。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_67b49604.mp3","dur":1.61},"fengfeng|再挨一下，我就站不住了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_651362ca.mp3","dur":3.02},"fengfeng|呼吸有點痛，剛才傷到胸口了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_9086aeef.mp3","dur":3.34},"fengfeng|這個箱子沒有上鎖。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_cf0888ba.mp3","dur":2.8},"fengfeng|箱蓋下面像是卡了東西。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_86ac2717.mp3","dur":2.55},"fengfeng|先把劍挪開，再掀蓋子。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_61f0c469.mp3","dur":2.67},"fengfeng|木板還乾燥，裡面的東西也許能用。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_cfd3381c.mp3","dur":4.17},"fengfeng|這個箱子挺深的。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_8a3b0321.mp3","dur":2.55},"fengfeng|封口繩還在，我解開看看。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_7eeb5722.mp3","dur":2.76},"fengfeng|醒來先看了一眼門口，劍還在原位。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_10a62bcb.mp3","dur":3.68},"fengfeng|醒來時還以為在商隊的帳篷裡。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_cd339744.mp3","dur":3.58},"fengfeng|這個墊子比山路邊的石頭舒服。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_fcc2d845.mp3","dur":4.36},"fengfeng|剛才把袖子壓皺了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_25bc2ad8.mp3","dur":3.11},"fengfeng|水喝過了，劍也帶上。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_035ce848.mp3","dur":1.99},"fengfeng|一覺睡到天亮，連夢都沒做。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_9c02e02c.mp3","dur":2.69},"fengfeng|香爐的煙整夜沒停。沒睡著也好，天亮就上路。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_c5f24fd9.mp3","dur":6.57},"fengfeng|手腕轉到這裡，劍就不會卡住。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_8af6fb83.mp3","dur":3.1},"fengfeng|踏步太早了，剛才改過來才順。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_8e5eff16.mp3","dur":3.53},"fengfeng|這回收劍沒有撞到腰帶。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_5317f1c2.mp3","dur":3.43},"fengfeng|劍刃上的小缺口磨平了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_13ac53a0.mp3","dur":2.12},"fengfeng|劍尖收回半寸，就不會掃到旁邊的人。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_7ed6629c.mp3","dur":3.45},"fengfeng|這一招接得上了。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_5f9922b3.mp3","dur":2.04},"fengfeng|抓住我的手，我扶你坐起來。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_ac0aeebe.mp3","dur":2.27},"fengfeng|醒了就好，先靠著這邊。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_f948e452.mp3","dur":3.43},"fengfeng|你的東西在旁邊，我幫你拿。":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_8b8102d4.mp3","dur":2.85},"fengfeng|有伏兵跳出來了！":{"file":"voice/fengfeng/fengfeng_c13118a9.mp3","dur":1.27},"daxia|難逢敵手。":{"file":"voice/daxia/daxia_2b878f36.mp3","dur":2.58},"daxia|深藏不露。":{"file":"voice/daxia/daxia_522b11b4.mp3","dur":2.82},"daxia|在下不才。":{"file":"voice/daxia/daxia_e74c58a0.mp3","dur":1.99},"daxia|承讓。":{"file":"voice/daxia/daxia_4181cd62.mp3","dur":0.72},"daxia|退隱江湖。":{"file":"voice/daxia/daxia_36175804.mp3","dur":1.45},"daxia|走火入魔。":{"file":"voice/daxia/daxia_84005d8a.mp3","dur":2.0},"nekomata|孩子，回去吧。再往上走，可不是逞強就能活下來的地方。":{"file":"voice/nekomata/nekomata_dec538bc.mp3","dur":8.17},"nekomata|你師父……婆婆見過他上去。那雙眼睛已經是紫的了。婆婆守在這，就是不想再有孩子跟上去送命。":{"file":"voice/nekomata/nekomata_861a8842.mp3","dur":16.81},"nekomata|好吧。那就讓婆婆看看，你到底有多少本事。":{"file":"voice/nekomata/nekomata_8b2a97f7.mp3","dur":5.69},"nekomata|老婆子還沒拿出真本事呢。":{"file":"voice/nekomata/nekomata_49202fba.mp3","dur":2.89},"nekomata|……好孩子。婆婆攔不住你了。":{"file":"voice/nekomata/nekomata_ac01905b.mp3","dur":4.8},"nekomata|記住，他還沒被魔氣吞光。你要快，再晚，剩下的就不是你師父了。":{"file":"voice/nekomata/nekomata_b70890ec.mp3","dur":10.75},"nekomata|大俠貓……婆婆見過他上去。那雙眼睛已經是紫的了。婆婆守在這，就是不想再有孩子跟上去送命。":{"file":"voice/nekomata/nekomata_1abaef93.mp3","dur":15.06},"nekomata|記住，他還沒被魔氣吞光。你要快，再晚，剩下的就不是大俠貓了。":{"file":"voice/nekomata/nekomata_7292d738.mp3","dur":9.88},"iron_claw|齒輪過熱……切換第二形態。":{"file":"voice/iron_claw/iron_claw_4ace1e71.mp3","dur":6.18},"orange_king|敢打擾本王用膳，就把身上的小魚乾全留下！":{"file":"voice/orange_king/orange_king_b53ce0b7.mp3","dur":6.23},"orange_king|一夥？本王只是趁塔冒出來的時候搬進來罷了。上面那位，本王可不敢惹。":{"file":"voice/orange_king/orange_king_7c08d47f.mp3","dur":9.4},"orange_king|你真的惹怒本王了！":{"file":"voice/orange_king/orange_king_13b8c7a5.mp3","dur":3.62},"orange_king|別打了別打了！本王只是想吃飽……":{"file":"voice/orange_king/orange_king_3a5c3654.mp3","dur":5.13},"orange_king|小魚乾在後面的桶子裡，拿去。上面那位上去以後，這塔裡就再也沒有能吃的東西了。":{"file":"voice/orange_king/orange_king_fbaa3882.mp3","dur":10.13},"cowcat_boss|塔下那群傢伙攔不住你，算你有點本事。接下來，就由本二當家親自陪你過招。":{"file":"voice/cowcat_boss/cowcat_boss_0482c19d.mp3","dur":10.42},"cowcat_boss|塔頂那位紫眼睛的大貓。他一句話，這座塔的傢伙都得聽。":{"file":"voice/cowcat_boss/cowcat_boss_28e7ed83.mp3","dur":8.44},"cowcat_boss|黑爪只是熱身，接下來換白爪！":{"file":"voice/cowcat_boss/cowcat_boss_6f9640d7.mp3","dur":4.38},"cowcat_boss|二當家……居然輸給你這種小不點。":{"file":"voice/cowcat_boss/cowcat_boss_e33adc28.mp3","dur":3.75},"cowcat_boss|去吧。跟你講，上面那位的脾氣比我差一百倍。他一掌拍下來，連我都不敢站著。":{"file":"voice/cowcat_boss/cowcat_boss_6d37bdeb.mp3","dur":8.74},"tanuki_lord|呵呵，小兄弟，何必急著動手？先陪老夫喝一杯吧。":{"file":"voice/tanuki_lord/tanuki_lord_1847f097.mp3","dur":8.35},"tanuki_lord|你師父？呵，上面那位灌的可不是酒，是魔氣。喝了就再也想不起自己是誰。":{"file":"voice/tanuki_lord/tanuki_lord_6eeb71e7.mp3","dur":10.53},"tanuki_lord|看仔細了——變！":{"file":"voice/tanuki_lord/tanuki_lord_7fc66cc6.mp3","dur":2.62},"tanuki_lord|呵呵……老夫本想騙你一杯酒的。":{"file":"voice/tanuki_lord/tanuki_lord_8db5379c.mp3","dur":5.5},"tanuki_lord|上面那位喝的不是酒，是魔氣。喝了就想不起自己是誰。小兄弟，你上去可要記得叫醒他。":{"file":"voice/tanuki_lord/tanuki_lord_265f7148.mp3","dur":11.26},"tanuki_lord|呵呵，小姑娘，坐下喘口氣。酒都倒好了，何必急著走呢？":{"file":"voice/tanuki_lord/tanuki_lord_51d8d154.mp3","dur":7.19},"tanuki_lord|上面那位已經快忘了自己是誰。小姑娘，到了上面，好好叫叫他；也許他還記得你的聲音。":{"file":"voice/tanuki_lord/tanuki_lord_8a7dd897.mp3","dur":10.64},"tanuki_lord|大俠貓？呵，上面那位灌的可不是酒，是魔氣。喝了就再也想不起自己是誰。":{"file":"voice/tanuki_lord/tanuki_lord_cd6f6b04.mp3","dur":10.4},"persian_lady|渾身髒兮兮的野貓，也敢闖進本小姐的樓層？":{"file":"voice/persian_lady/persian_lady_ae5a99bc.mp3","dur":4.88},"persian_lady|塔頂？那隻紫眼睛的大貓連本小姐都不放在眼裡。你要去送死，本小姐先把你攔下來。":{"file":"voice/persian_lady/persian_lady_cfc734ae.mp3","dur":13.22},"persian_lady|你們還站著做什麼？快替本小姐收拾他！":{"file":"voice/persian_lady/persian_lady_59a8e224.mp3","dur":5.04},"persian_lady|哼……本小姐的樓層，讓你過。":{"file":"voice/persian_lady/persian_lady_6ff714dc.mp3","dur":4.08},"persian_lady|上面那隻紫眼睛的大貓，本小姐才懶得管。你要去救他，隨便你。":{"file":"voice/persian_lady/persian_lady_b1608cd6.mp3","dur":7.9},"persian_lady|你們還站著做什麼？快替本小姐收拾她！":{"file":"voice/persian_lady/persian_lady_fa5c3369.mp3","dur":5.22},"frog_daimyo|呱——本大名的池子，什麼時候輪到一隻小貓來撒野了？":{"file":"voice/frog_daimyo/frog_daimyo_ff7548db.mp3","dur":7.12},"frog_daimyo|借過？上面那位紫眼睛的說了，一個都不許放上去。本大名答應過的事，呱，就要做到。":{"file":"voice/frog_daimyo/frog_daimyo_d4c07a72.mp3","dur":13.17},"frog_daimyo|來人！":{"file":"voice/frog_daimyo/frog_daimyo_90d7de12.mp3","dur":1.7},"frog_daimyo|呱……本大名答應過的事，沒做到。":{"file":"voice/frog_daimyo/frog_daimyo_9290746a.mp3","dur":4.76},"frog_daimyo|罷了。你這膽子，本大名認了。上去吧，池子借你過。":{"file":"voice/frog_daimyo/frog_daimyo_245e83ba.mp3","dur":8.21},"dragon_cat|……吵醒我的，要付代價。":{"file":"voice/dragon_cat/dragon_cat_402f9acf.mp3","dur":8.88},"hex_abbot|施主一路殺上來，手上的血債要怎麼算？":{"file":"voice/hex_abbot/hex_abbot_29b183f4.mp3","dur":9.48},"hex_abbot|你師父？呵……貧僧也曾想勸他。結果你看，貧僧的眼睛也紫了。":{"file":"voice/hex_abbot/hex_abbot_57386d32.mp3","dur":13.87},"hex_abbot|阿彌陀佛。":{"file":"voice/hex_abbot/hex_abbot_e1ea00eb.mp3","dur":1.42},"hex_abbot|……施主，貧僧清醒了。":{"file":"voice/hex_abbot/hex_abbot_05dba211.mp3","dur":3.63},"hex_abbot|這座塔，是照他記得的東西長出來的。越往上，越是他捨不得的。":{"file":"voice/hex_abbot/hex_abbot_b86ec6b5.mp3","dur":8.1},"hex_abbot|若還救得回來，只能靠他最掛念的人。快去。":{"file":"voice/hex_abbot/hex_abbot_089c4df3.mp3","dur":6.2},"hex_abbot|大俠貓？呵……貧僧也曾想勸他。結果你看，貧僧的眼睛也紫了。":{"file":"voice/hex_abbot/hex_abbot_1cb8066a.mp3","dur":12.7},"villager|大俠貓中了魔氣，跑進那座塔。球球追了進去，菲菲和噹噹昨天也去了。":{"file":"voice/villager/villager_dbfef111.mp3","dur":10.11},"villager|還沒有消息。你先把傷養好，我們一有消息就來告訴你。":{"file":"voice/villager/villager_9155a360.mp3","dur":6.85},"ninja_boss|上面那位，不是你認識的那隻貓了。":{"file":"voice/ninja_boss/ninja_boss_3eb28dad.mp3","dur":5.58}}